{"vid":"r3p5OmCceiA","source":"r3p5OmCceiA.en-en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"ARTHUR C. BROOKS: One of the hardest parts about leadership"},{"t":2.5,"txt":"is giving people hard news."},{"t":4.4,"txt":"I've been a CEO."},{"t":5.3,"txt":"I know."},{"t":5.8,"txt":"Sometimes you have to say that your job isn't here anymore."},{"t":8.7,"txt":"Sometimes you have to tell whole organizations"},{"t":11,"txt":"that there's going to be a new structure to things."},{"t":13.5,"txt":"And hard news is, well, it's hard."},{"t":16.2,"txt":"It's very important that leaders understand"},{"t":18.4,"txt":"that that is not a good argument for avoiding hard things."},{"t":24.4,"txt":"Now, one of the biggest problems that we have"},{"t":26.3,"txt":"is misunderstanding empathy and compassion."},{"t":30.6,"txt":"They're not the same thing."},{"t":32.4,"txt":"Empathy is to feel somebody else's pain."},{"t":35.2,"txt":"And when you're motivated entirely by empathy,"},{"t":38.3,"txt":"it becomes a really hard thing to do,"},{"t":40.4,"txt":"to do these difficult things, and you might even"},{"t":42.4,"txt":"be handcuffed and unable to do them."},{"t":44.6,"txt":"And you'll wait too long, when it gets even more"},{"t":47.1,"txt":"damaging to other people."},{"t":48.4,"txt":"Compassion is different."},{"t":49.5,"txt":"The greatest leaders are compassionate."},{"t":51.6,"txt":"Compassion has four parts to it, understanding a problem, feeling"},{"t":55.6,"txt":"enough of the pain, such that you can actually"},{"t":58,"txt":"be in the place of the person affected,"},{"t":60.3,"txt":"being able to be rational about what needs to be done,"},{"t":62.9,"txt":"and then having the courage to do it."},{"t":65.3,"txt":"That's what it comes down to."},{"t":67.2,"txt":"Being a truly compassionate leader is what people need."},{"t":70.5,"txt":"There greatest bosses are compassionate, not empathetic."},{"t":73.5,"txt":"And why are they compassionate?"},{"t":74.9,"txt":"Because they love people enough to do what actually"},{"t":77.7,"txt":"needs to get done."},{"t":78.8,"txt":"And you know what that is?"},{"t":79.9,"txt":"That's just leadership, at the end of the day."},{"t":83.7,"txt":"Let's say you're in a situation where"},{"t":85.2,"txt":"you need to downsize your employee base by about 20%"},{"t":88.3,"txt":"and that means a bunch of people, including people"},{"t":90.5,"txt":"that you've worked with for years are actually"},{"t":92.4,"txt":"going to lose their jobs."},{"t":93.7,"txt":"If the only tool in your arsenal is empathy,"},{"t":97,"txt":"that's going to be overwhelmingly hard"},{"t":99.7,"txt":"and maybe something you're going to put off,"},{"t":101.5,"txt":"and that's going to make things worse."},{"t":103.8,"txt":"Compassion is one in which you understand exactly why this"},{"t":107,"txt":"needs to be done."},{"t":108.2,"txt":"You put yourself in the place of other people, such"},{"t":110.4,"txt":"that you can understand what they're going through."},{"t":113.2,"txt":"You have a plan for how you're going"},{"t":114.7,"txt":"to transmit this information, and actually"},{"t":117.6,"txt":"what you're going to suggest to people who are affected."},{"t":120,"txt":"And then you have the courage to get"},{"t":121.5,"txt":"it done quickly, because that's in everybody's interests."},{"t":124.5,"txt":"That's fundamentally superior in every way."},{"t":127.2,"txt":"Now, one quick aside on this."},{"t":129,"txt":"How do you grease the skids a little bit?"},{"t":130.8,"txt":"The Buddhists talk about having a lovingkindness meditation."},{"t":134,"txt":"I'm a religious person, and one of the things that I've done"},{"t":136.5,"txt":"is I pray for people before I have to do a hard thing."},{"t":139.1,"txt":"I pray for the people that I'm actually"},{"t":140.8,"txt":"going to affect in this particular way,"},{"t":143.1,"txt":"and I pray for the courage."},{"t":144.3,"txt":"And so whatever your technique is, meditation, visualization,"},{"t":148.7,"txt":"prayer, I would recommend doing that, actually,"},{"t":151.3,"txt":"before you have the interactions with people, as well."},{"t":154.2,"txt":"So don't misunderstand what I've said here."},{"t":155.9,"txt":"I'm not saying not to have empathy."},{"t":157.6,"txt":"I'm saying not to have unaccompanied empathy."},{"t":160.8,"txt":"Empathy is only step number two of four steps."},{"t":164.2,"txt":"And when you shear it off from an understanding of the problem,"},{"t":167.2,"txt":"an understanding of what needs to be done,"},{"t":168.9,"txt":"and the courage to do it, then it becomes problematic"},{"t":171.4,"txt":"because it's on its own."},{"t":173,"txt":"It's an unaccompanied virtue, and as a virtue,"},{"t":176.1,"txt":"it can quickly turn into a vice."},{"t":177.6,"txt":"[AUDIO LOGO]"}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"ARTHUR"},{"t":0,"w":"C."},{"t":0,"w":"BROOKS:"},{"t":0,"w":"One"},{"t":0,"w":"of"},{"t":0,"w":"the"},{"t":0,"w":"hardest"},{"t":0,"w":"parts"},{"t":0,"w":"about"},{"t":0,"w":"leadership"},{"t":2.458,"w":"is"},{"t":2.458,"w":"giving"},{"t":2.458,"w":"people"},{"t":2.458,"w":"hard"},{"t":2.458,"w":"news."},{"t":4.42,"w":"I've"},{"t":4.42,"w":"been"},{"t":4.42,"w":"a"},{"t":4.42,"w":"CEO."},{"t":5.34,"w":"I"},{"t":5.34,"w":"know."},{"t":5.84,"w":"Sometimes"},{"t":5.84,"w":"you"},{"t":5.84,"w":"have"},{"t":5.84,"w":"to"},{"t":5.84,"w":"say"},{"t":5.84,"w":"that"},{"t":5.84,"w":"your"},{"t":5.84,"w":"job"},{"t":5.84,"w":"isn't"},{"t":5.84,"w":"here"},{"t":5.84,"w":"anymore."},{"t":8.72,"w":"Sometimes"},{"t":8.72,"w":"you"},{"t":8.72,"w":"have"},{"t":8.72,"w":"to"},{"t":8.72,"w":"tell"},{"t":8.72,"w":"whole"},{"t":8.72,"w":"organizations"},{"t":11.04,"w":"that"},{"t":11.04,"w":"there's"},{"t":11.04,"w":"going"},{"t":11.04,"w":"to"},{"t":11.04,"w":"be"},{"t":11.04,"w":"a"},{"t":11.04,"w":"new"},{"t":11.04,"w":"structure"},{"t":11.04,"w":"to"},{"t":11.04,"w":"things."},{"t":13.46,"w":"And"},{"t":13.46,"w":"hard"},{"t":13.46,"w":"news"},{"t":13.46,"w":"is,"},{"t":13.46,"w":"well,